
### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users

### Add a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Ali&email=ali@example.com

### Get all users after adding
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users

### Add duplicate email (should return 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/users
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Another Ali&email=ali@example.com
